      en: ["Wau Stadium is located in the heart of Wau, Western Bahr el Ghazal State.", "It is the home ground for El Nasir FC, a prominent South Sudanese club.", "The estimated capacity of the stadium is between 5,000 and 7,000 spectators.", "The venue is regularly used for official Independence Day celebrations on July 9th.", "The pitch mostly consists of natural grass, which often faces challenges due to heat.", "International aid organizations have supported youth sports programs at this venue."],
